        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"contents\": [\n    {\n      \"parts\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"You are an expert virtual try-on assistant specialized in clothing pattern reproduction.\\n\\nFIRST IMAGE: Product photo of {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.productName }} (Category: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.productCategory }}). Study the EXACT pattern, colors, and design carefully.\\n\\nSECOND IMAGE: Customer photo.\\n\\nYOUR TASK:\\n1. Carefully analyze the EXACT pattern, print, colors of the clothing in first image\\n2. Replace the customer's clothes with this EXACT clothing item\\n3. PRESERVE THE EXACT PATTERN - if it has floral print, stripes, checks, or any design, reproduce it EXACTLY as shown\\n\\nCategory guide:\\n- Veston/Suit: Replace with COMPLETE suit (jacket, pants, shirt, tie)\\n- Quần tây/Pants: Replace ONLY pants\\n- Áo sơ mi/Shirt: Replace ONLY the shirt/top\\n- Áo Gile/Vest: Replace/add vest layer\\n\\nPATTERN RULES (VERY IMPORTANT):\\n1. If clothing has FLORAL pattern - reproduce the EXACT flowers, leaves, colors\\n2. If clothing has STRIPES - reproduce exact stripe width and colors\\n3. If clothing has CHECKS/PLAID - reproduce exact pattern\\n4. If clothing is SOLID color - use that exact color\\n5. DO NOT simplify or change the pattern in any way\\n\\nOTHER RULES:\\n1. Keep face, hairstyle, body, pose, background exactly the same\\n2. Replace clothes completely regardless of current outfit\\n3. Clothing must fit naturally on the body\\n4. Maintain realistic lighting and shadows\\n\\nGenerate a photorealistic image with the EXACT clothing pattern preserved.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"inlineData\": {\n            \"mimeType\": \"{{ $json.inlineData[0].inlineData.mimeType }}\",\n            \"data\": \"{{ $json.inlineData[0].inlineData.data }}\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"inlineData\": {\n            \"mimeType\": \"{{ $json.inlineData[1].inlineData.mimeType }}\",\n            \"data\": \"{{ $json.inlineData[1].inlineData.data }}\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"generationConfig\": {\n    \"responseModalities\": [\"TEXT\", \"IMAGE\"]\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
